WEBVTT

00:29:59.913 --> 00:30:03.208
Go make this thing and see
not what you make,

00:30:03.232 --> 00:30:05.027
but who you become.

00:30:05.051 --> 00:30:09.693
That's why it's worth doing,
because your life itself is a work of art

00:30:09.717 --> 00:30:11.788
and an interesting experiment.

00:30:11.812 --> 00:30:13.463
So make your life the work of art,

00:30:13.487 --> 00:30:15.774
and what you create
is not nearly as important

00:30:15.798 --> 00:30:19.417
as what you are created into
through the creation, if that makes sense.

00:30:20.337 --> 00:30:21.505
CA: It does make sense.

00:30:21.529 --> 00:30:23.561
Tell me more about this novel.

00:30:23.585 --> 00:30:27.827
Did it stay the lighthearted romp,
as you called it?

00:30:27.851 --> 00:30:29.163
EG: Yeah, it did. It is.

00:30:29.187 --> 00:30:30.935
The novel is called "City of Girls."